 # Changelog
 
 All notable changes to the `harness-bootstrap` package. See `references/00-overview.md` for the full package description and versioning rules (patch/minor/major, same as `skill-authoring.md`'s "Bootstrap template versioning").
+
+## 7.1.0
+
+Design lifecycle: Architecture.md as the authoritative end-to-end solution record,
+plus a streamlined Publish close-out. Design skill template 3.0.0 → 3.1.0, dev
+skill template 2.0.0 → 2.1.0.
+
+- `solution/Architecture.md` is now the integrated E2E source of truth: it carries
+  every settled decision (Frame, Evaluate, developer clarification, WAF and review
+  feedback) with consequences and verification obligations; `Design.md`/`Stack.md`/
+  `Efforts.md` are supporting detail and may not introduce or contradict material
+  decisions (`references/04-solution.md`, `interfaces/architecture.md`,
+  `patterns/design-quality-gate.md`, `references/05-review-gate.md`).
+- Publish rework (`references/07-publish.md`): retired the option A/B hand-off.
+  After permanent docs are reviewed, a single wrap-up stop asks one question —
+  publish the `Efforts.md` implementation tickets to the tracker? — then ticket
+  publication (via the tracker agent), archive, design-ticket sync (worklog effort
+  derived from design metrics, no extra prompt), and a one-message close-out run
+  straight through. Doc updates now name the matching HLD/LLD/NFR intent per
+  destination and port only explicitly mapped diagrams.
+- Trackerless designs get a stable local ID (`DESIGN-YYYYMMDD-XXXX`) generated in
+  Frame and reused everywhere a ticket key is needed (`TEMPLATE.md`,
+  `references/01-frame.md`).
+- Efforts sizing guidance: delivery units are outcome-sized, boundary-aligned
+  slices fitting one focused dev session; simple spikes may be resolved via an
+  available MCP during design instead of becoming tickets
+  (`interfaces/efforts.md`, `references/04-solution.md`).
+- Artifact-path consistency sweep: every design/solution artifact reference is
+  spelled with its `design/` or `solution/` prefix across TEMPLATE, references,
+  patterns, and the Design Lifecycle guide doc; resume detection and WAF-review
+  targets use `01 Research*.md`/`02 Evaluate*.md` globs for multi-decision
+  stories; Frame's folder-creation block restores the `design/` subfolder;
+  metrics `--dir` is unambiguously the story's `design/` directory.
+- Design metrics: `wait_seconds_to_date` now includes the open wait; archiving
+  moves the whole `design/` directory including `design/stat.json`
+  (`patterns/metrics.md`, `scripts/`, `templates/stat*.json`).
+- Dev lifecycle cross-wiring: Context Gathering, Plan, and Document read
+  `solution/Architecture.md` as the design source of truth
+  (`skills/dev/TEMPLATE.md`, `references/01-context-gathering.md`, `03-plan.md`,
+  `06-document.md`, `docs/Engineering Guide/Lifecycles/01 Dev Lifecycle.md`).
 
